  "units": "Prototype radii and speeds divided by 32 and rounded; height authored for the standing 3D anatomy. Life, damage, resources and rewards tuned to the MMO content, not numeric parity.",
  "deferred": [
    "Prototype per-skill trees, court upgrades, grafted parts and ally-healer AI.",
    "Prototype perception cones, scent tracking, memory and flanking policy.",
    "Mage specialty kit substitutions use landed Firebolt, Frostbolt, Storm Bolt and Venom Bolt; lich uses Fireball and Shade Bolt; sentinel rally replaces Court Challenge; duelist Frenzy/Cleave replaces Twin Cut; abomination uses Ground Slam.",
    "Wraith hovering is presentation only; no flight or physical immunity is inferred.",
    "Broader living fauna and the rest of the prototype bestiary remain later entity passes."
  ],
  "preset_policy": "Original skill ids are retained where verified. Direct sentinel, duelist, abomination, lich and hound summons, corpse-targeted Raise Zombie and the four-school mage pool are new MMO presets exposing prototype bodies; they do not claim to be source skill definitions."
